{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/c4ff75d56fef6c2a0a66148207a8b462.avif?t=1768750913\" width=519 height=283 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Prison Fury to your Wishlist for launch updates and priority playtest invites. Join our Discord for giveaways.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Fury</strong> is a wild, social-first <strong>online 2-player</strong> co-op puzzle game. Team up with a friend and tackle huge chain-style puzzles that force you to plan, communicate, and react. Runs are intense and can take <strong>16\u201345 minutes</strong> \u2014 every choice matters and every run can explode into a chaos clip you\u2019ll want to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/4f82297927c281a564aa55f41b5a53fb.avif?t=1768750913\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you\u2019ll love it</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast to jump in, deep to master \u2014 one wrong move and everything can fall apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for streaming and laughs \u2014 clutch saves, fails, and insane comebacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure teamwork \u2014 your actions literally change your partner\u2019s world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the demo includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 playable demo level (mirrored prison)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 2-player co-op (invite friends)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A taste of the chained puzzle design and teamwork needed for full runs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Signature Puzzle Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Fury\u2019s core loop revolves around chained puzzles where each player\u2019s actions enable the other. Representative puzzle types include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Door Puzzle (Color Sequence)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/d4ec1f5061cb4127940479521dd4fe8d.poster.avif?t=1768750913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/d4ec1f5061cb4127940479521dd4fe8d.webm?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/d4ec1f5061cb4127940479521dd4fe8d.mp4?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform Chain Puzzle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/f0eb879d4395d63217ad779b991fc2bf.poster.avif?t=1768750913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/f0eb879d4395d63217ad779b991fc2bf.webm?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/f0eb879d4395d63217ad779b991fc2bf.mp4?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball Puzzle (Deposit &amp; Stop)</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/0c7f7f7cdc629c73e26cb400c256243a.poster.avif?t=1768750913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/0c7f7f7cdc629c73e26cb400c256243a.webm?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/0c7f7f7cdc629c73e26cb400c256243a.mp4?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sequence Pattern Puzzle (Pattern Transfer)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/8c0c2759c956b66aa5ac025d4c8ef445.poster.avif?t=1768750913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/8c0c2759c956b66aa5ac025d4c8ef445.webm?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/8c0c2759c956b66aa5ac025d4c8ef445.mp4?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid Obstacle Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/2e00410f9efa387a4c6284478ac93ca7.poster.avif?t=1768750913\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/2e00410f9efa387a4c6284478ac93ca7.webm?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/extras/2e00410f9efa387a4c6284478ac93ca7.mp4?t=1768750913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick How to Play (three steps)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invite a friend</strong>  into the Match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk and plan</strong> Go to the prison and figure out each section of the puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get out before its to late</strong> If you and your friend doesn't finished on time the lava will catch it up!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Campaign (2 players)</strong> \u2014 Full-length stages designed around chained puzzles and complex interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Mode (future, 2\u20134 players)</strong> \u2014 Planned for later, adding chaotic group play and streaming hooks.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap / Next steps (high level)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re adding: new themed worlds, more puzzle types, cosmetic drops (pets, emotes), QoL improvements, seasonal events, and a 4-player party mode. Roadmap details and dates will be posted on Discord and in patch notes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help Shape the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We run playtests all the time. Join our Discord to sign up, report bugs, and vote on new stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Prison Fury to follow development and be notified at launch.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137060?t=1768750913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137060?t=1768750913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/1f0b9aa81e114ada5d7f706ec5d463e3b5639c81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768750913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137060/1f0b9aa81e114ada5d7f706ec5d463e3b5639c81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768750913","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":